"North of North Wellness Center for the Body and Mind is the fanciest gym in Apex."
"It is near the Celena North campus, and its name is written in logograms beside a crescent logo."
"It is a 'soft-super gym' whose clients are mostly off-duty Adjusters, Shapers and other soft heroes."
"Three buildings joined by curving walkways sit among lawns and meditation gardens."
"Its menacing concrete building is covered in interface warnings over its one-ton kettlebells."
"Its elegant glass building has marble floors, a custom scent and an indoor track on the 4th floor."
"It offers a free smoothie bar, potion-therapy saunas, a superolympic pool and a morphing course."
"Its medical center gives consultations and Celena North High entrance physicals."
"Membership costs a steep annual fee."
"Roberta 'Bobby', a D-rank Agility Brute, trains Alden there."
